30. Find Customers With Consecutive Purchases

Example

Purchased on:

2025-01-01
2025-01-02
2025-01-03

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.window import Window
from pyspark.sql.functions import lag,datediff

w = Window.partitionBy(
"customer_id"
).orderBy("purchase_date")

df.withColumn(
"prev_date",
lag("purchase_date").over(w)
).withColumn(
"diff",
datediff(
"purchase_date",
"prev_date"
)
)

SQL:

SELECT *,
DATEDIFF(
purchase_date,
LAG(purchase_date)
OVER(
PARTITION BY customer_id
ORDER BY purchase_date
)
)
FROM sales;
